# ── Conflict event data ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ACLED: real-time conflict events with fatalities, actors, geo-location
# Register free at: https://developer.acleddata.com (token expires every 24h — regenerate when needed)
# ACLED_API_KEY=your_token_here
# ACLED_EMAIL=your_email_here

# ── Prediction markets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Metaculus: crowd forecaster count (probability provided by Manifold as fallback)
# Register free at: https://www.metaculus.com/accounts/register/
# METACULUS_API_TOKEN=your_token_here

# ── Economic data ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FRED: US monetary policy signals (yield curve, fed funds, VIX, CPI, HY spreads)
# Register free at: https://fred.stlouisfed.org/docs/api/api_key.html
# FRED_API_KEY=your_key_here

# ── No key required ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# World Bank API   — https://api.worldbank.org  (GDP, debt, inflation, WGI governance)
# GDELT            — https://api.gdeltproject.org  (global news events)
# RSS feeds        — Reuters, BBC, Al Jazeera, France24
# Polymarket       — https://gamma-api.polymarket.com  (real-money prediction markets)
# Manifold Markets — https://manifold.markets/api  (crowd prediction probabilities)
# Wikipedia        — https://en.wikipedia.org/api  (background context)

# ── V-Dem political indicators (one-time setup) ────────────────────────────────
# pip install vdemdata pandas
# python scripts/fetch_vdem.py
# → builds data/vdem_snapshot.json with democracy indicators for 180+ countries
